  61 ## Sockets
  62 - biped: `hand_r`, `hand_l` (palms), `head` (top of the head), `back` (between the shoulder blades), `foot_r`,
  63   `foot_l` (soles), `stick_blade`.
  64 - vehicle: `exhaust_l`, `exhaust_r`, `driver`.
  65 - bot: `tool` (tip of the right forearm: sparks, a tool), `head` (top of the hat: the beacon), `carry` (in front of the chest).
