   9 ## and a loop flag. Bones have identity rest rotations, so a pose is plain per-bone euler degrees:
  10 ##   +x swings a hanging limb forward (-Z) and tips an upright bone (spine, head) BACK; -x leans the torso forward,
  11 ##   +y turns left, +z rolls the top towards -X (left). Poses are blended as quaternions.
