  38 ## A Skeleton3D only schedules its skin update while it is inside the tree, and a pose set outside the tree leaves
  39 ## its dirty flag set for good (later pose changes are then never drawn). So: outside the tree every tick flushes
  40 ## the dirty bones, and on entering the tree the last pose is applied again one deferred call later (when the
  41 ## Skeleton3D child is inside the tree too). A rig can therefore be posed before it is added (spawn at a frame).
  42 func _enter_tree() -> void:
