 297 ## Contact slide (walker-feel): what the eye sees. Six points of the soles (heel, ball, toe tip of each boot); a point that is on
 298 ## the floor (under 15 mm) this frame and the last should not have moved: its horizontal speed over the floor is the slide.
 299 ## Per frame the worst point counts. Also: the frames with no point on the floor (flight or floating) and the lowest point
 300 ## seen (below 0 = through the floor).
 301 const SOLE: Array = [["LeftFoot", Vector3(-0.11, 0.0, 0.115)], ["LeftFoot", Vector3(-0.11, 0.0, -0.08)], ["LeftToes", Vector3(-0.11, 0.0, -0.225)],
 302 	["RightFoot", Vector3(0.11, 0.0, 0.115)], ["RightFoot", Vector3(0.11, 0.0, -0.08)], ["RightToes", Vector3(0.11, 0.0, -0.225)]]
